    {
      "id": "9dc4b80a-20ca-45ea-a7da-42d78fb876ff",
      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-05-04T08:05:57.000Z",
      "title": "NOCIL: Upcoming Board Decisions On Results And Dahej Expansion Will Support Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have kept the NOCIL price target steady at ₹217, citing updated assumptions around a slightly lower discount rate, modestly higher revenue growth and profit margin expectations, and a reduced future P/E multiple as key drivers of their unchanged view. What's in the News NOCIL has scheduled a board meeting on May 7, 2026 to consider and approve the audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the year ended March 31, 2026, along with the related audit report (Key Developments).",
