      "date": "2026-04-20T03:08:43.000Z",
      "title": "NOCIL: Dahej Capacity Expansion And Dividend Decisions Will Shape Balanced Outlook",
      "body": "Analysts have nudged their price target on NOCIL slightly higher to about ₹191 from ₹190.50, reflecting updated assumptions around profit margin and a lower future P/E multiple in their valuation work. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for May 7, 2026 to review and approve the audited standalone and consolidated financial results for the year ended March 31, 2026, and to consider payment of dividend on equity shares, if any (company filing).",
