      "date": "2026-04-05T22:04:07.000Z",
      "title": "NOCIL: Dahej Capacity Expansion And Stable Assumptions Will Support Long Term Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have maintained their price target for NOCIL at ₹190.5. The latest update reflects slightly adjusted assumptions around the discount rate and future P/E, while keeping fair value and margin expectations broadly unchanged. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled for Mar 16, 2026 to consider approval for capital expenditure of about ₹130 Cr for capacity expansion at the Dahej plant (Board Meeting agenda).",
